OL,3,AComedian impersonates Trump's dance
OL,4,Amoves, mocks trade talks at Canada
OL,5,Apress dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney brought a
OL,8,FDonald Trump impersonator on stage at
OL,9,FOttawa's annual press gallery dinner,
OL,10,Fwhere he poked fun at strained
OL,11,FUS-Canada relations and on-again,
OL,12,Foff-again trade talks.
OL,14,FThe impersonator, played by comedian
OL,15,FMark Critch of the sketch comedy show
OL,16,FThis Hour Has 22 Minutes, came out
OL,17,Fafter Carney jokingly pressed an
OL,18,F"emergency comedy button" during his
OL,19,Fspeech.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
