OL,3,AComedian impersonates Trump's dance
OL,4,Amoves, mocks trade talks at Canada
OL,5,Apress dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FCritch appeared alongside another actor
OL,8,Fimpersonating Carney, played by
OL,9,FCanadian sketch comedian Mark McKinney.
OL,11,F"We've got two Carneys here, it's a
OL,12,Fdisaster," the Trump impersonator said
OL,13,Fafter he walked on stage.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
